      case if there are
    </div>`, plain=`The system checks whether the customer can be deleted. This is only the case if there are`, tags=[(`Comment`, `JL:
Do we also have to wait for the maximum time span for chargebacks and returns?`)]) {
            list(ordered=false) {
                item(`no open orders and`, plain=`no open orders and`)
                item(`no open payments`, plain=`no open payments`)
